 *** experimental. The quasiparticle energies of the previous cycle are   ***
 *** fed back into the Green's function, so the error of the analytic     ***
 *** continuation propagates and accumulates over the cycles instead of   ***
 *** affecting one state only, as it does in G0W0. In tests on small      ***
 *** molecules the resulting deviation stayed below 100 meV, but this has ***
 *** not been established in general. Use at your own risk and check the  ***
